{
  "_comment": "The dashboard strategy's layout (plans/T055-generated-dashboard.md). An entity is named '<domain>.<translation_key>' and resolved in the device family of one inverter, never by entity id; 'a|b' takes the first that exists; a leading '~' resolves anywhere in the integration if unique, and never on its own keeps a card. '{n}' is expanded over a card's 'repeat'. In 'entities' an item is a reference, or an object with 'entity', 'name' and 'color'. 'view' makes a tap open that view. A section has 'cards', or 'groups' of them side by side, each with a heading. A section's 'control' is for administrators, locked, and kept by what '~' finds. 'below' puts a tile's input under its name. A card, section or view that resolves nothing is left out. tests/test_dashboard_layout.py holds every key to the integration's translations.",
  "module": 3,
  "revision": 5,
  "changes": [
    {"revision": 5, "text": {
      "en": "The Wallbox view starts the charge and picks its mode, behind the lock, and Home's energy flow of the day and its 24 hours show the car; and where the inverter's own energy history is read, a History view has its months and years.",
      "de": "Die Wallbox-Ansicht startet das Laden und wählt den Modus, hinter der Sperre, und der Energiefluss des Tages und die 24 Stunden auf Start zeigen das Auto; wo der eigene Energieverlauf des Wechselrichters gelesen wird, zeigt ihn die Ansicht Verlauf nach Monaten und Jahren."}},
    {"revision": 4, "text": {
      "en": "The Diagnosis view shows the overall progress, asks for missing answers before a start and confirms what it clears; the Energy view lists the sensors the Energy dashboard takes and can add them.",
      "de": "Die Diagnose-Ansicht zeigt den Gesamtfortschritt, fragt vor dem Start nach fehlenden Angaben und bestätigt das Löschen; die Energie-Ansicht nennt die Sensoren für das Energie-Dashboard und kann sie eintragen."}},
    {"revision": 3, "text": {
      "en": "The power flow and the day's energy flow come with the integration, and the Diagnosis view holds the diagnosis's settings.",
      "de": "Leistungs- und Energiefluss des Tages kommen mit der Integration, und die Diagnose-Ansicht enthält die Einstellungen der Diagnose."}},
    {"revision": 2, "text": {
      "en": "New views throughout: Home with the power flow, Energy, Diagnosis with the test results, and controls that stay readable while locked.",
      "de": "Alle Ansichten neu: Start mit dem Leistungsfluss, Energie, Diagnose mit den Testergebnissen und eine Steuerung, die auch gesperrt lesbar bleibt."}}
  ],
